# Shared Packages

## @tokamak-pilot/shared

- All TypeScript **interfaces and types** shared between frontend and backend go here
- `src/types.ts` — Domain types (Source, ContentEntry, AskRequest, AskResponse, User, etc.)
- `src/constants.ts` — Shared constants (API_PREFIX, port numbers, labels)
- Import as `@tokamak-pilot/shared` in both `apps/api` and `apps/web`
- When adding a new domain entity, define its type here first, then use it in both apps

## @tokamak-pilot/sdk

- Public TypeScript SDK for external consumers of the Tokamak Pilot API
- `TokamakPilotClient` class wraps all API endpoints
- When adding a new API endpoint, add the corresponding method to the SDK client
- Types are re-exported from `@tokamak-pilot/shared` — don't duplicate

## Adding Dependencies

- Use `pnpm --filter <package-name> add <dep>` to add deps to a specific workspace
- Example: `pnpm --filter @tokamak-pilot/web add sonner`
- Never install dependencies at the root unless they're dev tools (turbo, prettier)
